  "source": {
    "location": "inherited from test_fixed_summer.json (extends).",
    "purpose": "TEST FIXTURE for the W3 weather timeline (tests/unit/test_environment_weather_io.cpp): loads, validates and builds a WeatherTimeline. NOT a climatology: every season scalar (temp_mean_c, temp_range_k, rh_mean, pressure_msl_hpa, ground_temp_c), every regime parameter and every transition probability here is ASSUMED, chosen only to be plausible for a temperate mid-latitude site. The shipped home-region climate (temperate_de_home.json) takes its statistics from DWD climate normals in a later increment (weather plan 7.1, owner question Q11).",
    "seasons": "doy_span and days restated from test_fixed_summer.json (a merge patch replaces arrays whole).",
    "lags_s": "cloud/precip_on/precip_off/wind/temp_offset: the starting values of out/weather_plan.md section 7.1 (ASSUMED there); rh 1800 and pressure 3600 ASSUMED.",
    "precip_phase": "ASSUMED: snow at or below 0 degC, rain at or above 2 degC, sleet between (weather plan 3.2 [AS]); below 0.01 mm/h the published type is none (ASSUMED, the WMO trace limit of reported precipitation is 0.1 mm per report, not per hour).",
    "humidity": "precip_rh_floor 0.95: weather plan 3.4 [AS]; precip_full_mm_h 0.5 ASSUMED (the floor is reached at moderate drizzle).",
    "diurnal_temperature": "a_h 1.86, b 2.2, c_h -0.17: Parton & Logan 1981 (Agricultural Meteorology 23, 205-216) air temperature at 150 cm, as quoted in out/weather_plan.md section 3.4 [M, the paper itself not re-read in this session]; reference_cycle_s 86400 = the paper's real day; cloud_range_reduction 0.6 = weather plan 3.4 [AS].",
    "lightning": "distance_km 0.5-15: ASSUMED (audible thunder range is of the order of 15-25 km; not cited here)."
